A private `_DynamicModel` class is defined to create instances of the dynamic model class. This class has a constructor that takes a Map of attributes and overrides the `[]` operator to allow accessing and setting the dynamic model's attributes.

An API call is made using the `http` package, and the data is extracted from the response using the `json` package. The dynamic model class is generated using the `generateModelClass()` function. An instance of the dynamic model class is created, attribute values are set, and these values are printed.

